{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36547","headline":"夏日宿灵岩寺宗公院 · 罗邺","name":"夏日宿灵岩寺宗公院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺入千岩石路长，孤吟一宿远公房。\n卧听半夜杉坛雨，转觉中峰枕簟凉。\n花界已无悲喜念，尘襟自足是非妨。\n他年纵使重来此，息得心猨鬓已霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}